      "writtenOn": "2021-04-05T22:40:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I copied this value from Volteer.\n\nThe timeout of the watchdog is another config PLATFORM_EC_WATCHDOG_PERIOD_MS, which is 1600ms. I thought this config CONFIG_WDT_NPCX_DELAY_CYCLES means 500ms (16 cycles) before the 1600ms watchdog timeout such that it leaves some time for debug trace to be printed. But I need to check to confirm.",
      "parentUuid": "cda77c8f_80204cfa",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 61,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 61,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "7daf7861fb79eb00500d0d07b2a0bbbf8a5042fc",
